{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/757b2527eef055394cf06edd8854bf48.webp?t=1759760612\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind Split is a top-down puzzle game that challenges you to control two characters moving in opposite directions at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/4c924eb712d6232043eea01bc66e9576.avif?t=1759760612\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/7988473f818edb99be3c3cde742a2caa.webp?t=1759760612\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the editor mode, you can place the abilities you need in designated areas before the level begins.<br>Careful planning is essential: Which ability will help which character? Think ahead, position wisely, and test your strategy.<br><strong>But beware\u2014there's no going back once you've made your move.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/c65433323b79d410df5746b95974e608.poster.avif?t=1759760612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/c65433323b79d410df5746b95974e608.webm?t=1759760612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/c65433323b79d410df5746b95974e608.mp4?t=1759760612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/64fcca0b7e7a7df7adf7eb6069e53e04.webp?t=1759760612\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique puzzle experience, you control two characters simultaneously\u2014one can only move in the dark, while the other can only walk in the light.<br>You\u2019ll need to balance both sides, master the rules of their worlds, and switch between light and shadow with precision.<br>Timing, strategy, and insight will be your greatest allies on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/93a33a935812834e8aa498010bba55f9.poster.avif?t=1759760612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/93a33a935812834e8aa498010bba55f9.webm?t=1759760612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/93a33a935812834e8aa498010bba55f9.mp4?t=1759760612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan. Execute. Find the balance.</strong><br>Can Light and Shadow be united once again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer Music: <i>Dj Quads \u2013 It Just Makes Me Happy</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685530?t=1759760612","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685530?t=1759760612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/ddaf7ffda5c83bebbe9fce7283bf94b874c5f910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759760612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/ddaf7ffda5c83bebbe9fce7283bf94b874c5f910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759760612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3865620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/757b2527eef055394cf06edd8854bf48.webp?t=1759760612\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind Split is a top-down puzzle game that challenges you to control two characters moving in opposite directions at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/4c924eb712d6232043eea01bc66e9576.avif?t=1759760612\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/7988473f818edb99be3c3cde742a2caa.webp?t=1759760612\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the editor mode, you can place the abilities you need in designated areas before the level begins.<br>Careful planning is essential: Which ability will help which character? Think ahead, position wisely, and test your strategy.<br><strong>But beware\u2014there's no going back once you've made your move.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/c65433323b79d410df5746b95974e608.poster.avif?t=1759760612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/c65433323b79d410df5746b95974e608.webm